                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "100% Worth the buy!  Ironically I played these games out of order.  But it gives me great appreciation for the first knowing how much love they put into this one, and then into 2!  Good story, loveable characters, and an interesting simple yet entertaining elemental battle system.  If I had one gripe (and it's a small one), some of the enemy sprites are a little goofy.   Besides that I have no complaints.  Great little Indie RPG, from a developer who clearly loves his work.  I also HIGHLY recommend the second!",
